{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-10_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-10","title":"“這種事”","storyCode":"6-11","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"360aa04f30d4db445284e518168aff119cccc098300b5b392f1d5ae33ef4a37d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃，呃......！哈，哈......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（......中計了？！剛才的襲擊居然只是佯攻？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（再讓她切分我的隊伍，整支大隊都會失去作戰能力......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，得立刻聯繫上他們才行！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（可惡，為什麼我的手指不聽使喚？為什麼我在打冷顫！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（不能......不能被她追上！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（低沉咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"紅，別殺她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......！咕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定沒錯。紅聞到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"惡，假的。她不是狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"但氣味是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"這個氣味，是真狼。是第一匹真狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真狼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你這......該死的狼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"不要動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，怎麼會......？我竟然使不出力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......居然能壓制我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她還想發力。是狼的技巧。她從狼那裡學過撕咬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她想反擊。紅能刺穿她的脊髓，讓她癱瘓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"應該不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你。是你。我終於找到你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒......叛徒！找到你了，叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亞的女兒，柳德米拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！你怎麼配說我父親的名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"整個研究所和所有的科學家，都被烏薩斯滅口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是這麼認為的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你還敢這麼說？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為你，因為你這個卑鄙的叛徒和謝爾蓋一起出賣了我的父親，出賣了所有其他科學家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的髮色和你父親一模一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在說什麼？你為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想問，為什麼我沒對你的指控做出反應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你這人渣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"人渣。你希望我是怎麼樣的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我是該膽小懦弱，貪圖錢財和安逸......還是說，我應該殘忍冷酷，為達目的不擇手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的我，滿足你的想像了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想過......沒想過你是個徹頭徹尾沒心沒肺的冷血女人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你在殺謝爾蓋的時候，他是不是懺悔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他是亞歷克斯和米莎的父親？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哈哈哈......就是亞歷克斯帶我找到了他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合運動吸納了亞歷克斯，殺死了他的父親，追捕他的姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"紅。給她一次機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"給你一個殺掉我的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"給我機會？你真知道自己說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你想放棄生命？也想和那個靠出賣同事混到切爾諾伯格高層的謝爾蓋一樣，懺悔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你當然會後悔。你會為自己的做過的一切後悔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"平常我都會說，“我從來沒有後悔過”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我卻可以坦然地告訴你，我有一件非常後悔的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——但這和你父親的事情沒有任何關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......我要殺了你。我要殺了你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"“吞下死難者的苦”......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"起霧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"是法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"霧......不，本質是煙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"利用口腔內的發煙器官，神經指令性應激發煙。的確是依賴感染器官的特殊化源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"站在那裡說個不停......沒救的傢伙，你難道嚇得連怎麼表達恐慌都忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要背叛我的父親？為什麼要背叛科學家們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼！告訴我為什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"“凱爾希所長”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，我只是僥倖逃脫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你想我信你的鬼話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。你的父親教你讀過《正當與正義》，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"給五歲的你看這本書......伊利亞也真是缺乏常識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的很喜歡這本書。那是盛夏的某天，他抱著你和書經過窗戶，灌木叢映著陽光的橘色。他讓你向我招手，你賭氣別過臉去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"當天晚上他問我——如果我們封鎖了石棺，不把石棺內機械結構的存在透露給烏薩斯，能不能拯救更多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能阻止烏薩斯把這些機械運用在戰爭之中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你想用這些，這些......這些花言巧語干擾我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亞是石棺封鎖行動的發起者之一，他信奉的理念影響了他一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你繼承了你父親的鬥志，但你父親的身上不只有鬥志......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，你認定我是背叛者，你想殺我。你可以這麼做。只不過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"既然選擇了暴力這條路，就必定會面對比你更有力的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以再囂張一點。無論是什麼術師，都沒法看穿這片濃霧，也沒法分辨出我的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你會死的很慘。我一定，一定要你死得很慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......（吐舌聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"為了科學家們，為了感染者，我當然要殺了你，烏薩斯豢養的惡鬼，渣滓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我看起來像個術師？雖然我是感染者沒錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"出來，mon3tr。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？什麼......怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"怎，怎麼？你的脊椎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你自己並不受迷霧影響。你看得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會......怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔......！什麼，你是什麼，你......你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什麼！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是術師。我從不依賴源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"去，mon3tr。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呃呃呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼東西！這是什麼東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊，鬆手，鬆手啊，放開我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼它的殼我刺不穿？咿！別碰我，別碰我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"湮滅她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......頭上的墜落物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不滿的尖嘯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你鬧太大了。樓要塌了，別讓她被砸死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲嗡鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"殺了我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你明明能輕鬆地殺掉我！你難道也喜歡玩弄獵物？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"殺不掉你，我還活著做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你記著，就算死了，我也會永遠詛咒你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真準備好受死了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想死嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......呿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是背叛者呢？殺了我以後，你是不是會好受些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要......再說了！我會殺了你，我一定會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亞是我的學生，也是我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你父親是我帶過最好的研究員之一，他的無私和專注本可以將烏薩斯前推五年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了！為什麼要和我說這些，為什麼，我不想聽，我不關心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想。因為你一直在懷疑自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有給謝爾蓋解釋的機會，所以我替他說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——我不會出賣任何人，哪怕是謝爾蓋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"謝爾蓋是個優柔寡斷的人，但他並不貪婪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他剛出生的兒女被烏薩斯掌握在手裡，他為了拯救自己的親人，把你父親他們的行蹤告知了當局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"時至今日，米莎和亞歷克斯都死了。他出賣了秘密，卻誰也沒能保住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果之前是我去救米莎，也許她和碎骨......都不會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不對，不對！你明明擁有這種力量，為什麼不救我父親？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（威脅的低鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒法說服你父親離開研究所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，我在離開切爾諾伯格前把你送去了敘拉古，你卻自己回到了那座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你就像你父親一樣，有時候，意志連時間都能戰勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你總會回到切爾諾伯格，就像你會在這裡遇到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這一切一點意義都沒有？我父親和我做的一切......都毫無意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不。研究員們用他們的死保守了秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯至今都無法解析石棺內的裝置，他們放棄並封存了研究設施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，只有些微的能量被回收利用，用於驅動切爾諾伯格的核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“叛徒”，如果我真的配得上這個稱號，那我就是烏薩斯的叛國者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你父親的努力是有意義的。即使烏薩斯已經掩蓋了一切，你也還記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......但你做的一切，又是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯清洗了整個研究所，屠殺了科學家天性裡稀少又珍貴的悲憫。真正的背叛者是貪得無厭的帝國本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你現在的樣子，你殺了謝爾蓋，殺了一個連自己兒女都沒法保護的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你來到了龍門，如果你和你的感染者同胞們真的奪下了這座城市，接下來你會怎麼對待它的普通市民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是殺光他們？是奴役他們？又或者是把他們趕到荒野裡，讓他們自生自滅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們全部感染上礦石病，成為感染者，把你們的痛苦傳播給他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......還是說，你會和他們和平共處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們能嗎？柳德米拉，現在的整合運動能嗎？你是想用這樣的方式建立感染者的國家，還是說你想用這種方式去對抗烏薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想去對抗烏薩斯，為什麼要來龍門？想用恐怖對抗敵人，你該怎麼做才能比烏薩斯更恐怖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（凱爾希，她在疑惑。她很害怕，她想逃跑。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她能聽得見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“弑君者”，整合運動的仇恨與你的仇恨，已經被人玩弄在股掌之間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"想一想你的父親，想想伊利亞他對你的教育吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"想一想，你究竟想向誰復仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"引你走上這條用刺殺與恐怖鋪成的道路......你的領袖並不是什麼心性正常的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真正理想主義的人，不會放任別人為自己而死，更不會讓別人代自己行兇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這裡。走吧，離開這裡，換一條路走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"去換一條真正能改變這片大地的路......如果你真的想的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她的氣味消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希是不是一直想見她？現在為什麼不殺她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該不該殺死一條沒家的鬣狗，即使這個家是虛假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"問題好難。紅不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，紅，她會為殺了我這件事感到喜悅嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"不會。她現在也很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不代表法律，也無權審判別人。我們有能力去殺害別人，卻沒有任何權力宣稱殺戮是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她對謀殺感到興奮與快樂，我會立刻殺死她。我一定會這麼選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅知道。她不開心，她的呼吸很亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的她會成為一株病毒毒株，在狂熱的切爾諾伯格感染者中散佈“不安”這種病毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......一個人能活多少年歲，又能走過多少路？我們被蒙蔽的時間，總比我們看清事實的時候更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"何況認清事實和做出選擇又是另外兩回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在她從集體復仇心理中清醒過來的那天，她會離開整合運動。即使如此，謝爾蓋的血，切爾諾伯格人的血，永遠在她指縫間流淌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"紅......做出選擇以後，就沒辦法再回頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅明白。紅會努力，只殺狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那種味道你記下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅記下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼樣的味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......不討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有血腥味，但不是凱爾希你剛才說的那種，什麼心性什麼常的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真傻，塔露拉是德拉克人，狼怎麼會是她呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......氣溫下降了。時間很緊迫，是時候提高效率了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["？？？","凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["？？？","紅"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["弑君者"]}]}
